  m_text: You are a Wizard faced with the daunting task of removing all of the evil
    Goblins from this village. The magic Goblins all agree to leave, with the condition
    that you must defeat them in a strategy game. In this game, you control units
    and set up a battlefield of terrains on a 5x5 grid, and the first one to 0 life
    loses. For more info about the rules, see the readme on this game's repo. Or,
    you can just learn by playing.
